WEBVTT

00:08:00.730 --> 00:08:02.363
And that's --

00:08:02.830 --> 00:08:04.330
There is now --

00:08:04.363 --> 00:08:07.230
Breakthrough Energy Ventures
is one group doing that

00:08:07.263 --> 00:08:09.263
and drawing lots of other people in.

00:08:09.863 --> 00:08:11.963
But then the most difficult thing is

00:08:11.997 --> 00:08:14.063
we actually need markets
for these products

00:08:14.097 --> 00:08:18.097
even when they start out
being more expensive.

00:08:18.130 --> 00:08:19.763
And that's what I call Catalyst,

00:08:19.797 --> 00:08:26.263
organizing the buying power of consumers
and companies and governments

00:08:26.297 --> 00:08:28.397
so that we get on the learning curve,

00:08:28.397 --> 00:08:30.630
get the scale going up,